window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A woman with a secret. A man of duty. A prophecy untold.</p> <p>Forced to seek shelter from the Highest, Ophelia and the Oneiroi must form an unlikely alliance with Fantasy.</p> <p>As bonds form, so does the undeniable truth. Fate awaits Ophelia and the Oneiroi, who can’t pursue their destinies without the help of their new ally. But when the Highest wreak havoc on them all, soon Ophelia discovers a new kind of destruction.</p> <p>When everything changes, when the light rises, Will Ophelia put her heart aside for the greater good, or will the Highest destroy everything they've created.</p> <p><i>Fantasy</i> is the third captivating book in <i>The Oneiroi Cycle</i>, a Why Choose series about the Greek gods of Sleep and their soulmate, Ophelia. If you love fated mates, pining, and worlds inspired by mythology, buy <i>Fantasy </i>and be swept away!</p>"; 
